s10-3-p13 = realized (prose (cons "**Receipt-bearing delivery.** Enrich the in-flight credit message with a unique transfer identifier \(u\), source, destination, and amount. A state records sets \(\mathsf{sent}\), \(\mathsf{delivered}\), and \(\mathsf{acknowledged}\). Delivery of \(u\) requires \(u\notin\mathsf{delivered}\), consumes its in-flight credit exactly once, credits the receiver, and inserts \(u\) into \(\mathsf{delivered}\). Acknowledgment requires \(u\in\mathsf{delivered}\) and records a receipt; it transfers no credit. A return is a new uniquely identified transfer in the reverse direction, subject to available credit. Each transfer preserves the conservation invariant, and duplicate delivery is excluded by the delivered-set premise. Failures leave in-flight credit represented until an explicitly defined recovery or cancellation transition acts on it." nil)) (cons (cite RcptState "RcptState") (cons (cite RcptMove "RcptMove") (cons (cite rcpt-move "rcpt-move") (cons (cite rcpt-allowed "rcpt-allowed") (cons (cite rcpt-ack-total "rcpt-ack-total") (cons (cite rcpt-conserved "rcpt-conserved") (cons (cite rcpt-no-redelivery "rcpt-no-redelivery") nil)))))))
